<details x-data="notifications" class="notification-center" @toggle="if($el.open)load()" @click.outside="$el.open=false" @keydown.escape="$el.open=false"><summary :aria-label="'اعلان‌ها، '+formatNumber(unread)+' خوانده‌نشده'"><x-icon name="bell" size="20" /><span x-show="unread>0" class="notice-count" x-text="formatNumber(Math.min(99,unread))"></span></summary><div class="notification-panel"><div class="notification-heading"><div><strong>اعلان‌ها</strong><small x-text="formatNumber(unread)+' اعلان خوانده‌نشده'"></small></div><button type="button" aria-label="بستن اعلان‌ها" @click="$el.closest('details').open=false"><x-icon name="x" size="17" /></button></div><button x-show="unread>0" type="button" class="mark-read-all" @click="readAll()"><x-icon name="check-check" size="16" />همه را خواندم</button><div class="notification-items"><template x-for="entry in items" :key="entry.id"><button type="button" class="notification-item" :class="entry.read_at?'':'unread'" @click="read(entry)"><span class="notice-icon"><span x-show="entry.kind==='message'"><x-icon name="message-square" size="19" /></span><span x-show="entry.kind==='published'"><x-icon name="circle-check" size="19" /></span><span x-show="!['message','published'].includes(entry.kind)"><x-icon name="file-check2" size="19" /></span></span><span><strong x-text="entry.title"></strong><span x-text="entry.message"></span><time x-text="formatDate(entry.created_at)"></time></span><i x-show="!entry.read_at" class="unread-dot"></i></button></template><div x-show="!items.length" class="notice-empty"><x-icon name="inbox" size="32" /><strong>همه چیز مرتب است</strong><p>پیام‌های جدید و مطالب آماده بررسی اینجا نمایش داده می‌شوند.</p></div></div></div></details>
